doc ///
  Key
    (getIntRoots, RingElement)
    getIntRoots
  Headline
    get integer roots of a $b$-function
  Usage
    getIntRoots b
  Inputs
    b:RingElement
      the output of one of the $b$-function routines
  Outputs
    :List
      the list of the integer roots of $b$
  Description
    Text
      Returns the list of integer roots of $b$. Useful for picking the
      shift exponent in $D$-module restriction and integration.
    Example
      R = QQ[x, dx, WeylAlgebra => {x=>dx}]
      b = globalBFunction(x^3)
      getIntRoots b
  SeeAlso
    globalBFunction
    bFunction
///

