doc ///
  Key
    (bFunctionRoots, RingElement)
    bFunctionRoots
  Headline
    get roots of a $b$-function
  Usage
    bFunctionRoots b
  Inputs
    b:RingElement
      the output of one of the $b$-function routines
  Outputs
    :List
      the list of the roots of $b$
  Description
    Text
      Returns all (complex) roots of $b$, not just the integer ones (cf. @TO getIntRoots@).
    Example
      R = QQ[x, dx, WeylAlgebra => {x=>dx}]
      b = globalBFunction(x^3)
      bFunctionRoots b
  SeeAlso
    globalBFunction
    bFunction
    generalB
///

